&lt;li&gt;Experience working across the Civilian, DOD and NATSEC agencies, inclusive of experience in Federal Law Enforcement, Healthcare, Financial/Regulatory and Military operations and logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidates must have an active TS (Top Secret Clearance)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
