&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant corporate legal experience in private practice and/or in-house.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience advising venture-backed companies on private financings, M&amp;amp;A, corporate governance, and other strategic transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mix of top-tier corporate law firm and in-house experience, ideally at a late-stage, high-growth technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of U.S. corporate and securities law applicable to high-growth private companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with equity compensation, cap tables, capitalization records, and corporate governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing subsidiaries, corporate formations, and entity compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of managing outside counsel and working effectively with senior executives, Boards, investors, and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent judgment, drafting, negotiation, and project-management skills, with the ability to move seamlessly between complex transactions and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Carta or similar equity management platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international expansion and foreign entity formation and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
