&lt;li&gt;Lead the end‑to‑end delivery of enterprise AI projects, ensuring execution on time, within scope and budget, and aligned to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage comprehensive project plans and related artifacts to ensure successful delivery and compliance with contractual and financial targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify expansion opportunities through adjacent use cases, new stakeholders, and additional datasets where Snorkel can deliver outsized value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary interface between client C‑suite, Snorkel’s technical teams, and Snorkel leadership, orchestrating multiple workstreams to deliver integrated outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and continuously refine best practices, templates, and delivery frameworks to make engagements scalable and repeatable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As part of our team, you will have the opportunity to work on all aspects of complex National Security problems.&lt;/li&gt;
