&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hcg0di&quot; data-start=&quot;1404&quot; data-end=&quot;1542&quot;&gt;Experience translating ambiguous customer or stakeholder requirements into technical specifications, workflows, and delivered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gw3h0b&quot; data-start=&quot;1543&quot; data-end=&quot;1666&quot;&gt;Experience integrating systems via APIs and building custom tooling or workflows for non-standard technical requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
