&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in services, marketplace, or data-driven businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to delivery, operations, or workforce-based execution models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting planning cycles and executive reporting&lt;/li&gt;
